      "writtenOn": "2025-02-07T03:02:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK, I think now I understand the whole idea.\nWhat you proposed is a thing like \"uniform buffer lives in encoder instead of pipeline\" and pipeline pick data from that encoder based on their immediate data range definition.",
